cpu: k3d-gpu canary/engines.toml vllm-cpu (vLLM on the CPU as the fit sizes it); recipes 2 hardware_overrides blocks
  --dtype: k3d-gpu bfloat16; recipes unset -> explained [intel-runtime, bench/eatflow/results/2026-10-20/H51/B1-hold1/values.yaml]: EAT's own vLLM CPU defaults (defaultModelConfigs.extraCmdArgs) pass --dtype bfloat16, which k3d-gpu's EAT overlay keeps
  --gpu-memory-utilization: k3d-gpu unset; recipes 0.8 x2 (Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B, Qwen/Qwen3-8B) -> explained [fit, console/fit.py _flags]: on the CPU the fit sizes the KV cache with VLLM_CPU_KVCACHE_SPACE (GiB)
